   "title": "2026年『がんみち夏まつり』7/25(土)に雁道商店街で開催！！【瑞穂区イベント】",
   "html": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>2026年7月25日(土)、瑞穂区・雁道商店街で『<span class=\"marker\"><strong>第66回がんみち夏まつり</strong></span>』が開催されます！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>チラシはこちら<br />\n<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-20411\" src=\"https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/742977210_4630629817262604_7752631667015118267_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1040\" height=\"735\" srcset=\"https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/742977210_4630629817262604_7752631667015118267_n.jpg 1040w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/742977210_4630629817262604_7752631667015118267_n-300x212.jpg 300w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/742977210_4630629817262604_7752631667015118267_n-1024x724.jpg 1024w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/742977210_4630629817262604_7752631667015118267_n-768x543.jpg 768w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/742977210_4630629817262604_7752631667015118267_n.jpg 856w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1040px) 100vw, 1040px\" /><br />\n</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【スケジュール】<br />\n17:00～ オープニングセレモニー<br />\n17:10～17:30 高蔵高校演舞(バトン＆カラーガード)<br />\n17:30～18:00 安心安全防犯セミナー(瑞穂警察署・瑞穂消防署)<br />\n18:00～19:00 みつるぎ消防団<br />\n18:00～20:45 サプライズイベント<br />\n21:00 フィナーレ<br />\n</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>健康診断なんかも、できるみたい！<br />\n<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-20415\" src=\"https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745393230_2332443250827647_1467854239368799142_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1096\" height=\"1550\" srcset=\"https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745393230_2332443250827647_1467854239368799142_n.jpg 1096w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745393230_2332443250827647_1467854239368799142_n-212x300.jpg 212w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745393230_2332443250827647_1467854239368799142_n-724x1024.jpg 724w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745393230_2332443250827647_1467854239368799142_n-768x1086.jpg 768w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745393230_2332443250827647_1467854239368799142_n-1086x1536.jpg 1086w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745393230_2332443250827647_1467854239368799142_n.jpg 856w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1096px) 100vw, 1096px\" /></p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-20416\" src=\"https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/743777197_3129432833924038_7200778364233328082_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1096\" height=\"1550\" srcset=\"https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/743777197_3129432833924038_7200778364233328082_n.jpg 1096w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/743777197_3129432833924038_7200778364233328082_n-212x300.jpg 212w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/743777197_3129432833924038_7200778364233328082_n-724x1024.jpg 724w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/743777197_3129432833924038_7200778364233328082_n-768x1086.jpg 768w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/743777197_3129432833924038_7200778364233328082_n-1086x1536.jpg 1086w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/743777197_3129432833924038_7200778364233328082_n.jpg 856w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1096px) 100vw, 1096px\" />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>会場はもちろん、雁道商店街。<br />\n<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-13631\" src=\"https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/357236478_657839659597694_7779664423811829329_n-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" srcset=\"https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/357236478_657839659597694_7779664423811829329_n-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/357236478_657839659597694_7779664423811829329_n-300x225.jpg 300w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/357236478_657839659597694_7779664423811829329_n-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/357236478_657839659597694_7779664423811829329_n-768x576.jpg 768w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/357236478_657839659597694_7779664423811829329_n-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/357236478_657839659597694_7779664423811829329_n-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/357236478_657839659597694_7779664423811829329_n-scaled.jpg 856w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong> <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-18463\" src=\"https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/1752834874925-e1752890075643.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1417\" srcset=\"https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/1752834874925-e1752890075643.jpg 2000w, https://mizuhon.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/1752834874925-e1752890075643.jpg 856w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><br />\n</strong><br />\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" style=\"border: 0;\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3262.88881100265!2d136.9172831752972!3d35.134448159817445!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x60037bfc61352f09%3A0x7af8c64ec82ff946!2z6ZuB6YGT5ZWG5bqX6KGX!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1690154863696!5m2!1sja!2sjp\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&#8220;<span class=\"marker\"><strong>サプライズイベント</strong></span>&#8220;が気になる方はぜひ会場へ！</p>\n<p>雁道の夏の風物詩へぜひ、足を運んでみてください！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"simple-box1\">\n<p><strong>【第66回がんみち夏まつり】</strong><br />\n日時：2026年7月25日(土) 午後5時～午後9時<br />\n場所：雁道商店街［<a href=\"https://www.kinsyachi.com/event/1549/\">ホームページ</a>］</p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">＊この記事情報は2026年7月15日現在のものです。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">＊詳細につきましては主催者へご確認ください。</span></p>\n"
  },
